Third-party assets
==================

Streamline "Plump Color" icons
------------------------------
Some of the marks in `app/components/marks.tsx` are derived from Streamline's
Plump Color icon set.

  Source:  https://icon-sets.iconify.design/streamline-plump-color/
           https://github.com/webalys-hq/streamline-vectors
  Author:  Streamline (https://streamlinehq.com)
  Licence: CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)

Used under CC BY 4.0, which permits commercial use and requires attribution.
The icons are modified: each ships two hardcoded colours, and both are
rewritten as CSS custom properties so the marks take Forma's palette. The
attribution is also shown to readers on /brand.

